{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BZDNljjULk1795479501.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>輝達股價急升三成一，令看跌輝達的衍生產品，單日市值蒸發過百億美元。</p><p></p><p>由GraniteShares發行、在美國掛牌的2倍槓桿做空輝達ETF，單日跌六成三。同由GraniteShares發行，但在英國掛牌的3倍槓桿做空輝達產品，更急跌近九成。</p><p></p><p>根據金融數據公司ORTEX數據，輝達空倉單日帳面損失，估計高達122億美元，折合約956億港元，創下2019年以來，最大單日虧損紀錄，回吐上星期超過105億美元帳面盈利之餘，更錄得巨大虧損。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.918023+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.750799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:27:53.127001+00:00","content_hash":"36a8f784790a1ae60ad5b052289cfffbb3a428dfb7e1c60ea0ef6734f7f6b0ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.918023+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}